WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.008
At night, Muhammad quietly left Makkah, setting out for Madinah.

2
00:00:04.408 --> 00:00:09.136
Allah made a spider spin its web and doves build their nests, protecting them.

3
00:00:09.536 --> 00:00:12.848
The people of Madinah opened their arms and welcomed him.

4
00:00:13.248 --> 00:00:16.008
Together with everyone, he built the first mosque.

5
00:00:16.408 --> 00:00:20.896
Later, he returned to Makkah peacefully with his people, without any revenge.

6
00:00:21.296 --> 00:00:26.048
He told everyone: fear Allah, and treat one another as brothers.

7
00:00:26.448 --> 00:00:32.976
The revelation is complete, and Islam is perfected. The Quran is Allah's miracle for all of humanity.
